# Prompt: the Sound update for Alva

You are working on **Alva** (`hiyroscript/alva`), a 2D platform fighter for the browser. It is plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript with Canvas 2D. There are no frameworks, no build step and no WebGL. Before you change anything, read `CLAUDE.md`, `ALVA_SPEC.md`, `UPDATES.md`, `docs/README.md`, `docs/gameplay/stages.md`, `docs/gameplay/battle.md`, `docs/gameplay/local-play.md`, `docs/gameplay/practice.md`, `docs/gameplay/watch-mode.md`, `docs/gameplay/online-play.md` and `docs/systems/defense.md`, and follow every rule in them. The owner calls this work **the Sound update**. When you finish, add an entry for it to `UPDATES.md` and a line for it to `CLAUDE.md`'s list of named updates.

Alva has no sound today. `js/core/audio-manager.js` is an empty foundation: it creates an `AudioContext` on the first pointer or key gesture, keeps a register/load/play map, and holds nothing. A few menu components already call `this.app.audio.play('move')`. **Those calls must stay silent.** Never register a `move` sound or any other sound this prompt does not name.

