2. Practice Ground plays only a factory ambience.
3. The opponent-ejected, player-ejected and Local/Watch universal ejection sounds, Deflect (on a real turn-back only), Perfect Shield, Shield block and Shield hold all play correctly for every fighter, every mode and every point of view.
4. Local Play always uses the universal ejection sound and the Victory version, except on a draw, where every mode plays the stage's Draw version.
5. No other sound exists anywhere in the game, and menus stay silent.
6. Settings › Audio works with mouse, touch, keyboard and gamepad, persists as version 11 and applies live.
7. `node --test` passes, the docs and `UPDATES.md` are updated, and the itch release still builds.
8. Before you finish, actually listen through each stage's 5 versions and every transition, using a headless render or an offline `OfflineAudioContext` dump to WAV if you can't play audio directly. Fix any clicks, level jumps, clashing keys or transitions that miss the beat.
